# Normalise line endings on commit. Without this, a CRLF working tree against
# LF blobs makes whole files show as modified forever — entrypoints/content.ts
# reported 781 changed lines while being byte-identical after stripping CR.
# Checkout still uses native endings, so Windows keeps CRLF locally.
* text=auto

# Never touch these.
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.onnx binary
*.spm binary
*.safetensors binary
